<title>USA: Parlux Fragrances Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>Parlux Fragrances Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PARLUX FRAGRANCES, INC.</p>
<p>			 CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>			  (unaudited)</p>
<p> Three Months Ended September 30,	     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales				    $25,503,173 $13,925,214</p>
<p> Operating income			     3,965,342   2,993,521</p>
<p> Net earnings				   2,148,680   1,507,879</p>
<p> Fully diluted earnings per share(1)	   0.12	  0.15</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding(1)</p>
<p>						   18,499,359  10,172,774</p>
<p> Six Months Ended September 30,		 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales				     44,242,800  24,133,983</p>
<p> Operating income			     7,547,281   5,236,433</p>
<p> Net income				     4,082,755   2,649,845</p>
<p> Fully diluted earnings per share(1)	   0.25	  0.26</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding(1)</p>
<p>						   17,047,534  10,000,260</p>
<p>(1) -- 1995 share data reflects the retroactive effect of the two-for-one stock split in November 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
